## .NET build output
bin/
obj/
[Oo]utput/
artifacts/

## Fallout working dirs. Leading **/ matters: a pattern with an interior slash is
## anchored to this file's directory, so `.fallout/temp/` alone ignored only a root
## one and let every scenario's build logs through.
**/.fallout/temp/
**/.fallout/build-attempt*.json
## Regenerated on every run from the build's parameters — derived, not source.
**/.fallout/build.schema.json

